{"recall":{"defs":[["Transformer","Attention + position-wise FFN layers with residuals and LayerNorm, no recurrence."],["Encoder","Bidirectional self-attention stack giving contextual token vectors."],["Decoder","Masked self-attention + cross-attention + FFN; generates autoregressively."],["Position-wise FFN","Same 2-layer MLP (D → 4D → D) at every position."],["Cross-attention","Queries from decoder, keys/values from H_enc."],["MLM","Mask 15% of tokens and predict them (BERT)."],["Autoregressive LM","Predict the next token (GPT)."],["ViT","Encoder over image patches + [CLS] token."],["LoRA","Frozen W plus trainable low-rank BA."]],"formulas":["X=\\text{Embedding}+PE","\\text{head}_h=\\mathrm{softmax}(Q_hK_h^T/\\sqrt{d_k})V_h,\\ \\text{MHA}=\\text{Concat}(\\cdot)W^O","Z_1=X+\\text{MHA}(\\text{LN}(X)),\\ Z_2=Z_1+\\text{FFN}(\\text{LN}(Z_1))","\\text{LN}(\\mathbf x)=\\gamma\\frac{\\mathbf x-\\mathbb E[\\mathbf x]}{\\sqrt{\\text{Var}[\\mathbf x]+\\epsilon}}+\\beta","\\text{enc layer}\\approx12d^2,\\ \\text{dec layer}\\approx16d^2","P(y_t\\mid y_{<t},\\mathbf x)=\\mathrm{softmax}(D^{(N)}W_{out}+b_{out})_t","N=HW/P^2=196","W_{new}=W_{frozen}+\\alpha BA"],"takeaways":["No recurrence: attention connects all positions in parallel.","Each layer: MHA + FFN, each with LayerNorm and a residual.","Encoder-only / decoder-only / encoder–decoder for understand / generate / transform.","ViT = Transformer encoder on 16×16 patches.","Fine-tune pretrained models with small LR; LoRA for efficiency."],"confused":[["Self- vs cross-attention in the decoder","Over its own (past) tokens vs over the encoder output."],["MLM vs autoregressive LM","Fill masked tokens using both sides vs predict next token from the left."],["Pre-norm vs post-norm","LN before vs after the residual sum."],["Full fine-tuning vs LoRA","All weights vs a small low-rank add-on."],["Learned vs sinusoidal positions","ViT/BERT learn them; the 2017 Transformer used sinusoids."]],"minute":"The Transformer (2017) removes recurrence. Inputs are token embeddings plus positional encodings. An encoder layer computes Z₁ = X + MHA(LN(X)) and Z₂ = Z₁ + FFN(LN(Z₁)), with multi-head attention (e.g. 12 heads of 64) and a position-wise FFN that expands to 4d; it has about 12d² parameters. A decoder layer adds causal masking to self-attention and a cross-attention sub-layer over the encoder output, about 16d², and ends with a linear layer and softmax over the vocabulary. Stacks are 6 (original), 12 (BERT-base) or more layers. Encoder-only models (BERT, MLM pretraining) suit classification, NER and extractive QA; decoder-only models (GPT, next-token pretraining) suit generation; encoder–decoder models (T5, BART) suit translation and summarisation. ViT splits a 224×224 image into 196 16×16 patches, adds a [CLS] token and learned positions, and classifies from [CLS]. In practice, load a pretrained model from Hugging Face and fine-tune with learning rate 2e-5–5e-5 for 2–5 epochs, or use LoRA, W + αBA, to train under 1% of the parameters."},"flashcards":[["Three RNN problems the Transformer fixes","Sequential processing, vanishing gradients, fixed memory"],["Encoder purpose","Contextual representation of each input token (bidirectional)"],["Decoder purpose","Generate one token at a time (causal)"],["Encoder input (3)","X = Embedding(tokens) + PE(positions)"],["Multi-head attention (6)","MHA(Z) = Concat(head₁..head_H)Wᴼ"],["Position-wise FFN","D → 4D → D with ReLU/GELU, same weights at each position"],["Layer norm (7)","γ(x − E[x])/√(Var[x] + ε) + β, per token"],["Encoder layer (9)–(10)","Z₁ = X + MHA(LN(X)); Z₂ = Z₁ + FFN(LN(Z₁))"],["Encoder layer parameters","≈ 12 d_model²"],["Decoder layer (12)–(14)","Masked MHA, cross-attention, FFN, each with LN + residual"],["Decoder layer parameters","≈ 16 d_model² (33% more)"],["Output layer (18)–(19)","logits = D W_out + b; softmax over |V|"],["ViT patches for 224×224, P = 16","196 patches, 197 tokens with [CLS]"],["ViT classification","LN([CLS] output) → linear → softmax"],["BERT pretraining","Masked language modelling (15% of tokens)"],["GPT pretraining","Autoregressive next-token prediction"],["T5 / BART pretraining","Text-to-text span corruption / denoising"],["Fine-tuning learning rate","2e-5 to 5e-5, 2–5 epochs, AdamW"],["LoRA (28)","W_new = W_frozen + α·BA, r ≪ d"]],"coverage":{"topics":[{"simple":["why","h1"],"deep":["t9-recap","t9-rnnbottle","t9-solution","t9-apps","t9-three"],"viz":["archPicker"],"status":"complete"},{"simple":["what","demo"],"deep":["t9-arch"],"viz":["transformerFlow"],"status":"complete"},{"simple":["h2","h3","h4","h5","h6"],"deep":["t9-embed","t9-mha","t9-ffn","t9-ln","t9-resid","t9-encparams","t9-encstack"],"viz":["transformerFlow","paramCalc9"],"status":"complete"},{"simple":["h7"],"deep":["t9-declayer","t9-decparams","t9-decstack"],"viz":["transformerFlow","paramCalc9"],"status":"complete"},{"simple":["h8"],"deep":["t9-vitwhy","t9-vitarch","t9-vitenc","t9-vitcnn"],"viz":["vitPatches"],"status":"complete"},{"simple":["h9"],"deep":["t9-variants","t9-enconly","t9-deconly","t9-encdec","t9-traininf","t9-when"],"viz":["archPicker"],"status":"complete"},{"simple":["h10"],"deep":["t9-pretrain"],"viz":[],"status":"complete"},{"simple":["h10","h11","example"],"deep":["t9-hf","t9-finetune","t9-ftexample","t9-practice","t9-lora","t9-summary"],"viz":["loraLab"],"status":"complete"}],"elements":[["Recap of attention; what's missing","rule","t9-recap"],["RNN bottleneck: three problems","rule","t9-rnnbottle"],["Transformer solution table; impact timeline","table","t9-solution"],["From Transformers to modern AI","rule","t9-solution"],["Real-world applications","rule","t9-apps"],["Three architectures; selection criteria","diagram","t9-three"],["Industry models comparison","table","t9-apps"],["Full Transformer architecture diagram","diagram","t9-arch"],["What the encoder does","rule","t9-arch"],["What the decoder does","rule","t9-arch"],["Input embedding","definition","t9-embed"],["Eq. (1)–(2) positional enco